:"present"}],"source_ids":[210,211,212]}],"sources":{"211":{"url":"https://acp.cd/province/haut-lomami-situation-calme-sur-toute-letendue-de-la-province/","title":"Haut-Lomami : situation calme sur toute l'étendue de la province","publisher":"ACP","date":"2026-09-01"},"212":{"url":"https://actualite.cd/2026/07/28/haut-lomami-les-fardc-repoussent-une-attaque-des-mai-mai-bukama","title":"Haut-Lomami : les FARDC repoussent une attaque des Maï-Maï à Bukama","publisher":"Actualite.cd","date":"2026-07-28"},"210":{"url":"https://fr.allafrica.com/stories/202607300103.html","title":"Itinérance dans le Haut-Lomami - Après Kamina, le Chef de l'État est arrivé à Kaniama-Kasese","publisher":"AllAfrica / ACP","date":"2026-07-30"},"215":{"url":"https://fr.allafrica.com/stories/202604030193.html","title":"Six blessés dans une altercation à Kaniama Kasese, le Service National déplore l'incident","publisher":"AllAfrica","date":"2026-04-03"},"216":{"url":"https://www.aip.ci/cote-divoire-aip-inter-rdc-plus-de-8-300-jeunes-formes-au-centre-de-kaniama-kasese-dans-le-cadre-du-service-national/","title":"RDC : plus de 8 300 jeunes formés au centre de Kaniama Kasese dans le cadre du Service national","publisher":"AIP"},"217":{"url":"https://actualite.cd/2024/04/15/rdc-retour-kinshasa-de-1600-anciens-kuluna-apres-une-reeducation-kaniama-kasese","title":"RDC : retour à Kinshasa de 1600 anciens kuluna après une rééducation à Kaniama Kasese","publisher":"Actualite.cd","date":"2024-04-15"}},"units":{"CD7303-kaniama":"Kaniama territory (Haut-Lomami) has no reported armed-group control; Mai-Mai/Bakata Katanga activity in 2025-2026 was concentrated in Bukama, Malemba-Nkulu, Mitwaba and Pweto, and the province was reported calm in September 2026. Kaniama town is a state-run territorial centre with permanent PNC and FARDC presence and received a presidential visit in late July 2026. The Kaniama-Kasese site west of town hosts the Service National training and re-education centre (former kuluna and youth) and its agro-industrial domain, run by the paramilitary Service National. Rural villages are assessed as default state presence (PNC)."}}